# The gate judges a pull request, so the gate's owner reviews any change to the
# gate itself. Two paths make the gate: `mise.toml` holds `tasks.check`, and
# `.github/workflows/` holds the job that runs it. This file is listed too,
# because dropping a line here would leave the other two unowned.
#
# GitHub reads this file from the base branch to pick reviewers, but a request
# is not a requirement. Branch protection or a ruleset has to require the
# review, or the owner only gets a notification.

/.github/workflows/ @Bafbi
/.github/CODEOWNERS @Bafbi
/mise.toml @Bafbi
